id=openssc_audiopolicy
name=OpenSSC Audio Policy (Opus to software A2DP)
version=0.2.2
versionCode=4
author=OpenSSC
description=Full-software A2DP: when persist.bluetooth.a2dp_offload.disabled=true, routes SBC, AAC and Opus A2DP to the software bluetooth_qti module (patched policy copy bind-mounted at boot, nothing shipped from the vendor).
